helf","rationale":"DailyMed should not be cited for boxed-warning verification, and PubMed/NCBI sources are needed for aliases, epilepsy type, and half-life facts.","requires_user_approval":false,"status":"incorrect","supporting_sources":["https://api.fda.gov/drug/drugsfda.json?search=application_number:%22NDA008855%22&limit=5","https://api.fda.gov/drug/label.json?search=openfda.generic_name:%22phensuximide%22&limit=1","https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/116142/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK2597/"]},{"current_value":"N/A 0%: no current FDA/DailyMed label identified; FDA Orange Book product listing does not provide adverse-event percentages.","field":"adverse_symptoms_percentages","proposed_value":"N/A: no current FDA/openFDA label identified; FDA/openFDA Drugs@FDA and Orange Book product listings do not provide adverse-event percentages.","rationale":"The 0% wording is not supported by absence of a label and should not imply zero adverse events. FDA/openFDA label searches found no current phensuximide/Milontin label.","requires_user_approval":false,"status":"incorrect","supporting_sources":["https://api.fda.gov/drug/label.json?search=openfda.generic_name:%22phensuximide%22&limit=1","https://api.fda.gov/drug/label.json?search=openfda.brand_name:%22MILONTIN%22&limit=1","https://api.fda.gov/drug/drugsfda.json?search=application_number:%22NDA008855%22&limit=5"]},{"current_value":"Historical/unspecified epilepsy (specific FDA-labeled seizure category not available from Orange Book listing)","field":"epilepsy_type","proposed_value":"Historical absence/petit mal epilepsy evidence; specific FDA-labeled seizure category not available from FDA/openFDA product listing.","rationale":"FDA/openFDA product data do not provide the labeled seizure category, but PubMed evidence specifically indexes phensuximide under absence epilepsy and older Milontin literature refers to petit mal epilepsy.","requires_user_approval":false,"status":"incorrect","supporting_sources":["https://